  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Reunion**: rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n- **E. Lenny**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive01-05-17** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 13 songs; 148 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Sam K joined on alto sax for most of the show, including Hurry Up...And Wait, 1 in 7, Reunion, Cannonball and It's Your Thing [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive01-05-17**: taped by Pete Costello; transferred by Kurt; source: Matrix: [(On Stage) Schoeps cmc621 > Snake] + [SBD via RCA] > Beringer 802a-ADC-20 > Sony TCD-D8 [1]. Also: Matrix recording: on-stage Schoeps cmc621 mics via snake, mixed with soundboard feed through RCA, Bringer 802a and ADC-20 into a Sony D8; Pete Costello made the recording and Kurt did the transfer; no transfer details were provided [1]",
